== Walkthrough ==

''[[Regren]] is located at 352, 269, 77 in the Emerald Warriors ([[Warrior]]) Guild Hall.''

You say, 'Hail, Regren'

: Regren says, 'Welcome, Warrior. Show the Emerald Warriors your mettle and bring me a ruined wolf pelt, some bat fur, some bone chips, and a spiderling eye from the depths of Greater Faydark. If you succeed, my admiration and a reward will be yours. To battle!'

'''Hand [[Regren]] your [[Recruitment Letter]].'''

:: ''The Recruitment Letter reads:''

:: <code>The Emerald Warriors is now recruiting strong, able bodied elves for service. Please turn in this Recruitment Letter to Master Regren to enlist.</code>

: Regren says, 'Welcome to the Emerald Warriors. Hmmm, you have a lot of training to do, so lets get started right away. Here's our guild tunic. Represent us well, young ______.'

